<title>SWITZERLAND: Swissair to consolidate reservations.</title>
<headline>Swissair to consolidate reservations.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissair AG said it planned to consolidate its three regional telephone reservation centres in Switzerland at a single location.</p>
<p>Consolidating the regional centres at Zurich, Geneva and Basle would cut staff to 122 from 145 and save about three million Swiss francs annually, Swissair said.</p>
<p>It said Zurich and Geneva were the leading candidates for the centre's location. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
